      "statement": "SyncState and Document tables reuse Graph-specific column names as source-neutral: drive_id becomes a synthetic filesystem key, drive_item_id carries relative paths for filesystem sources, content_hash stores sha256 for filesystem or quickXorHash for SharePoint, and delta_token/resume_token stay NULL for filesystem (no pagination/resume needed).",
